  "display_name": "FirstCore \u2014 Waive assessed overdraft fee (Fee Management)",
  "description": "Signs on to the FirstCore portal, acknowledges the authorized-user notice, opens Account Servicing \u00BB Fee Management, runs an account inquiry for the supplied account_id, and waives the assessed OVERDRAFT ITEM FEE, returning the host reversal confirmation number. Classifies no-record, closed-account, host-congestion and manager-override outcomes.",
  "goal": "In Fee Management, look up the account and waive the assessed overdraft fee, reaching the reversal confirmation. Record a reusable capability. Use 12345 for the successful recorded flow, then probe 55555 for transient congestion, 99999 for a closed-account rejection, 77777 for no records, and 00000 for a manager-override modal; probe the blocking modal last.",
